.TH INCOGNITO-TERMINAL-ROOT 1 "2026-10-15" "Incognito Terminal 1.3.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
incognito-terminal-root \- start an authenticated root Incognito Terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B incognito-terminal-root
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B incognito-terminal-root
uses
.BR pkexec (1)
to start
.BR incognito-terminal (1)
with root's configuration and shell environment. Any arguments are forwarded to
.BR incognito-terminal (1).
.PP
See
.BR incognito-terminal (1)
for privacy behavior, options, files, limitations, and exit status.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR incognito-terminal (1),
.BR pkexec (1)
